WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:38:24.197 --> 00:38:27.057
Yes, Indeed. 

00:38:32.660 --> 00:38:35.902
 
They call it: The Oneironaut. 

00:38:38.697 --> 00:38:42.155
The wondrous device...

00:38:44.712 --> 00:38:48.726
... that grants one...

00:38:50.546 --> 00:38:52.546
... eyes.

00:39:04.949 --> 00:39:13.208
There, at the graveyard of our achievements, ...

00:39:13.208 --> 00:39:19.657
... where now prayers are heard nevermore, ...

00:39:19.657 --> 00:39:24.977
... will the line between the dreams blur.

00:39:24.977 --> 00:39:29.368
And when The Red Tide comes, ...

00:39:29.368 --> 00:39:33.332
... the waters rise.
 

00:39:33.332 --> 00:39:36.723
And all will be taken...

00:39:36.723 --> 00:39:41.785
... by The Endmost Night.

00:39:46.467 --> 00:39:50.948
Those who walk The Lucid Lane, ...

00:39:50.948 --> 00:39:59.536
... trying to wake themselves by raising Cain:  

00:39:59.536 --> 00:40:07.148
The Bourgeoisie Immaculate.

00:40:16.340 --> 00:40:21.518
 
And upon the Crown of Creation...

00:40:21.518 --> 00:40:25.960
... lonely stands a galvanist, ...

00:40:25.960 --> 00:40:30.326
... trying to reanimate...

00:40:30.326 --> 00:40:35.604
... a wilting flower's myth:

00:40:35.604 --> 00:40:47.395
Kyrious, God from the Machine.

00:40:57.679 --> 00:41:03.986
And the pilgrims, who finally found the way, ...

00:41:03.986 --> 00:41:11.047
.... for in their Call Beyond The Fifth Wall will break:

00:41:15.562 --> 00:41:24.702
The Panopticon of the Deep Sea.

00:41:30.343 --> 00:41:35.167
Like ants, we dug deep.

00:41:35.167 --> 00:41:39.126
Like ants, we built high.

00:41:39.126 --> 00:41:45.522
 
And like ants, we'll be squashed...

00:41:45.522 --> 00:41:51.297
By the sea and the sky.

00:42:06.384 --> 00:42:12.037
Ahh... What have we created.

00:42:13.205 --> 00:42:17.824
But worry not.

00:42:17.824 --> 00:42:22.696
For it will always end how it had begun...

00:42:25.020 --> 00:42:27.344
Behold..

00:42:27.344 --> 00:42:32.091
The rising..

00:42:32.330 --> 00:42:34.330
Sun.

